1
00:00:00,162 --> 00:00:01,492
(Sheldon:)Hello, Howard.

2
00:00:01,663 --> 00:00:05,333
(Sheldon:)I've realized that you scaring me
was all in jest.

3
00:00:05,542 --> 00:00:09,502
(Sheldon:)Allow me to say, job well done.

4
00:00:20,974 --> 00:00:22,604
(Sheldon:)Perfect.

5
00:00:25,479 --> 00:00:29,649
- What are you doing?
- Science. You wouldn't understand.

6
00:00:30,609 --> 00:00:33,569
Okay, well, see you. I'm going out.

7
00:00:40,702 --> 00:00:42,952
(Sheldon:)I thought you were leaving
the apartment.

8
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,710
(Leonard:)Yeah, me too.
I can't make up my mind.

9
00:00:46,458 --> 00:00:52,018
(Sheldon:)Are you concerned because the world
is filled with big dogs and bullies?

